  "ingredients": [
    "1 (10 ounce) package egg roll wrappers",
    "2 cups vegetable oil, or as needed"
  ],
  "steps": [
    {
      "text": "Gather the ingredients.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/0IOdPrLiEu9WPEAmy_VOdgwEzRY=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/ALR-222814-crispy-chinese-noodles-restaurant-style-step-01-8b5a1eafaebb407fb799403122200959.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/222814/step_01.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Cut egg roll wrappers into 1-inch strips.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/BW_ifQnTN8ijNn4lvTWoeRNhXEM=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/ALR-222814-crispy-chinese-noodles-restaurant-style-step-02-a263f9e13c7c4b49803373eb3e5cbaed.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/222814/step_02.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Heat a wok over medium heat until very hot. Pour oil into the hot wok and heat until shimmering. To test the heat, lower the tip of a wooden chopstick into the oil; if it bubbles vigorously, the oil is ready.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/ORzeaQj_WE6SnvOjyy67yTTQBW4=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/ALR-222814-crispy-chinese-noodles-restaurant-style-step-03-98d837d3d0994ba88cf121920851252a.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/222814/step_03.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Gently place 2 to 3 strips into hot oil; cook until beginning to brown on one side, 30 seconds to 1 minute. Gently flip and cook until crisp and golden brown all over, 30 seconds to 1 minute more.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/BuyDzVPISWYt34HKbpGu9pb5v2c=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/ALR-222814-crispy-chinese-noodles-restaurant-style-step-04-22cbbab1850846c5822dfaeb4367ba05.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/222814/step_04.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Use a slotted spoon to transfer fried strips to a paper towel-lined plate. Repeat to fry remaining strips.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/wklwrzvEdDB3v1xgeClyfWe_nLY=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/ALR-222814-crispy-chinese-noodles-restaurant-style-step-05-c2f350d1ba424c71b35e5ee90dcfa3d3.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/222814/step_05.webp"
    }
